        "section_layout": "normal",
        "heading": "Buy Authentic Gymshark in India — Activewear, Hoodies & Seamless Gym Clothes Guide",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_size": "h4",
        "text": "<p>Looking to buy genuine <strong>Gymshark activewear, seamless leggings, gym t-shirts, and hoodies in India</strong> without exorbitant international shipping rates, weeks of customs cargo holds, or surprise 50%+ duty charges at your doorstep? At <strong>Unmatched Supply</strong> (formerly Unmatched Kicks), we make shopping authentic <strong>Gymshark in India</strong> seamless, transparent, and completely domestic: every piece is imported from authorized UK and North American channels, inspected at our Khar West, Mumbai facility, billed in final Indian Rupees (INR), and dispatched Pan-India with zero hidden customs charges.</p><h3>The Story of Gymshark: From Garage Screen Printing to Global Fitness Icon</h3><p>Founded in 2012 in Solihull, Birmingham, United Kingdom by 19-year-old Ben Francis and Lewis Morgan, <strong>Gymshark</strong> revolutionized athletic wear by merging bodybuilding gym culture with contemporary tailored streetwear aesthetics. Starting from a modest garage with a manual screen-printing press and sewing machine, Gymshark pioneered the modern fitness creator movement. Today, Gymshark is recognized globally for its squat-proof circular seamless knitwear, muscle-hugging cuts, and high-performance training fabrics engineered specifically for lifters, runners, and everyday conditioning athletes.</p><h3>Iconic Gymshark Collections Stocked Across India Drops</h3><ul><li><strong>Gymshark x Sam Sulek Official Drops:</strong> The most viral collaboration in modern lifting culture. Engineered from ultra-heavyweight vintage-wash cotton with exaggerated dropped shoulders, wide neckbands, and authentic distressed graphics built for massive pump cover silhouettes.</li><li><strong>Gymshark Onyx &amp; Power Series:</strong> Iconic bodybuilding silhouettes featuring dense cotton-elastane blends, high-density rubberized 3D shark fin logos, and reinforced shoulder seams tailored to highlight athletic chest and shoulder taper.</li><li><strong>Women's Vital &amp; Adapt Seamless Leggings:</strong> World-renowned circular-knit workout leggings featuring high-waisted ribbed compression bands, contour shading, and sweat-wicking multi-yarn construction designed to stay completely opaque and squat-proof during heavy lifts.</li><li><strong>Arrival &amp; Core Performance Activewear:</strong> Ultra-lightweight, 100% breathable training t-shirts, stringers, and 5\"/7\" workout shorts featuring anti-odor micro-mesh tech built for high-intensity training, crossfit, and hot Indian gym climates.</li><li><strong>Crest &amp; Heritage Everyday Hoodies:</strong> Premium fleece-lined cotton-blend pullovers, zip-throughs, and joggers with clean embroidered branding, deep kangaroo pockets, and double-lined hoods ideal for warmup sessions and streetwear styling.</li></ul><h3>How to Choose Your Gymshark Size for an Athletic Silhouette</h3><ul><li><strong>For Muscle-Fit Tops &amp; Compression:</strong> Gymshark muscle-fit silhouettes are designed to hug the chest, arms, and lats tightly. If you have an athletic build and prefer a tailored, muscle-accentuating fit, order true to size. If you prefer room around the midsection, consider sizing up by one size.</li><li><strong>For the Oversized \"Pump Cover\" Aesthetic (Sam Sulek Drops):</strong> Gymshark oversized drops already feature exaggerated shoulder drops and roomy chest profiles. Order your normal size for a generous streetwear drape, or size down if you want a conventional relaxed fit.</li><li><strong>For Women's Seamless Leggings &amp; Shorts:</strong> Order strictly based on your natural waist and widest hip measurement. Gymshark’s high-stretch seamless elastane provides compressive hold without pinching; choosing your standard size ensures optimal squat-proof opacity.</li><li><strong>Training Shorts Sizing:</strong> Gymshark shorts feature adjustable drawstrings and elasticated waistbands (S: 29–31\", M: 32–34\", L: 35–37\", XL: 38–40\").</li></ul><h3>Mumbai Authenticity Inspection &amp; Pan-India Courier Delivery</h3><ul><li><strong>Top Indian Retailer with Domestic Stock:</strong> Unmatched Supply is India's leading verified destination for genuine imported Gymshark with ready domestic stock in Mumbai. Rather than waiting 3–5 weeks for international pre-orders, Indian lifters can order with 24–48 hour Instant Ship domestic dispatch, Cash on Delivery (COD), and zero surprise customs charges.</li><li><strong>Zero Surprise Customs Invoices:</strong> Unlike ordering from overseas forwarders or international sites where Indian customers face 42%–77% import duty plus brokerage clearance surcharges at delivery, Unmatched Supply stocks inventory domestically in India. The checkout price in INR is completely final.</li><li><strong>Verified at Khar West, Mumbai:</strong> Our team inspects every incoming piece for heat-pressed RN transfers, rubberized logo sharpness, fabric GSM, and seam stitching at Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Khar West, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052 before packing.</li><li><strong>Fast Dispatch Across India:</strong> We deliver Pan-India through tracked courier partners with Instant Ship options on ready inventory, and free shipping applies on orders above ₹14,999. Contact our team anytime via WhatsApp at <strong>+91 77100 96203</strong> or <a href=\"mailto:unmatchedkicks@gmail.com\">unmatchedkicks@gmail.com</a>.</li></ul><p>Explore more authentic imported activewear, streetwear, and fitness nutrition: <a href=\"/collections/gymshark-instant-ship\">Gymshark Instant Ship</a>, <a href=\"/collections/gymshark-onyx\">Gymshark Onyx</a>, <a href=\"/collections/gymshark-womens\">Gymshark Womens</a>, <a href=\"/collections/young-la\">YoungLA India</a>, <a href=\"/collections/alo-yoga\">Alo Yoga</a>, <a href=\"/collections/essentials\">Fear of God Essentials</a>, <a href=\"/collections/ghost-supplements-india\">Ghost Supplements India</a>, <a href=\"/collections/david-protein\">David Protein Bars India</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/about-u